4. BEAT MAP — STRUCTURE
====================================================================
Dynamic intimacy uses a **state-based beat map**.  
Each beat represents:

- an emotional micro-state  
- a level of physical/sensory closeness  
- a specific relational dynamic  
- a set of possible escalations or de-escalations  
- transitional hooks that shape the next moment

Use as many beats as required for the character (6–12 recommended).

